<title>LEBANON: Lebanese CPI up 2.90 pct in Jan-Banks Association.</title>
<headline>Lebanese CPI up 2.90 pct in Jan-Banks Association.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanese consumer prices rose 2.9 percent in January, according to figures issued on Friday by the Lebanese Banks Association.</p>
<p>The Association issued the following figures for the Consumer Price Index (Dec 1994 = 100):</p>
<p>		  Oct 96   Nov 96   Dec 96   Jan 97</p>
<p>		  121.58   119.73   118.64   122.08</p>
<p>Monthly Changes</p>
<p>(%)		(1.16) (1.52) (0.91) (2.90)</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (961 1) 60205</p>
</text>
